# Sprint: Product Detail Page Testing — Minimal High-Impact Suite

**Date:** 2026-04-02  
**Source Research:** `_project/research/product-detail-testing-strategy.md`  
**Target State:** 3 E2E tests + 2 integration tests proving PDP works correctly across all dimensions  
**Estimated Duration:** 4 days  
**Scope Lock:** STRICT — No component styling changes, test-only sprint

---

## Scope Lock Rules (VIOLATION = SPRINT ABORT)

| Rule | Constraint |
|------|------------|
| **NO** | Changes to `globals.css` |
| **NO** | Changes to PDP component styling (ImageGallery, ProductInfo, ProductDetail, RelatedProducts) |
| **NO** | Changes to data fetching logic (getProductBySlug, getRelatedProducts) |
| **NO** | Changes to store/basket logic |
| **YES** | Add `data-testid` attributes to components for test targeting |
| **YES** | Add test files only |
| **YES** | Add test fixtures/mocks as needed |

---

## Pre-Applied Lessons (From INDEX.md)

| Keyword | Lesson | Prevention Rule Applied |
|---------|--------|------------------------|
| baseline | pre-flight-baseline-check.md | DoD 0: Pre-sprint build verification |
| workflow | command-singular-focus.md | Clear delegation: /sprint → /implement → /test |
