## Gap Analysis (Current → Target)

| ID | Gap | Current State | Target State | Severity |
|----|-----|---------------|--------------|----------|
| G1 | **Zero E2E Coverage** | No PDP e2e tests exist | Golden Path test exists, runs on 8 browsers | CRITICAL |
| G2 | **No RWD Validation** | Manual viewport testing only | Automated 5-viewport matrix test | CRITICAL |
| G3 | **No Link Integrity Proof** | Related product links unverified | All links validated, zero 404s | HIGH |
| G4 | **No Error State Coverage** | Invalid slugs untested | 404 handling, empty states tested | HIGH |
| G5 | **No Data Contract Tests** | API changes break UI silently | Integration tests catch contract drift | MEDIUM |

