## DoD 0: Pre-Sprint Baseline (MANDATORY FIRST)

- [ ] Run `npm run build` and document result
- [ ] Run existing tests: `npx playwright test --grep "regression"` (if any)
- [ ] Document baseline: Build [PASS/FAIL], Tests [PASS/FAIL]
- [ ] If build fails: Document pre-existing issues, mark KNOWN, proceed with caution
- [ ] If tests fail: Document pre-existing failures, mark KNOWN

**Baseline Evidence Log:**
```
Date: 2026-04-02
Build: [ ] PASS / [ ] FAIL — Details: ________________
Existing Tests: [ ] PASS / [ ] FAIL — Details: ________________
Pre-existing Issues: ________________
Proceed: [ ] YES / [ ] NO
```

