## Verification Commands

```bash
# Run all PDP tests:
npx playwright test tests/e2e/product-detail/ --reporter=line

# Run specific suite:
npx playwright test tests/e2e/product-detail/golden-path.spec.ts --project=chromium

# Run integration tests:
npx vitest run tests/integration/product-api.spec.ts --reporter=verbose

# Full verification:
npm run build && npx playwright test tests/e2e/product-detail/
```

