## Success Criteria (Sprint Lock Conditions)

| Criteria | Target | Verification |
|----------|--------|--------------|
| Golden Path | 8/8 browsers pass | `npx playwright test --grep "golden"` |
| RWD Test | 5/5 viewports pass | `npx playwright test --grep "RWD"` |
| Edge Cases | 4/4 cases pass | `npx playwright test --grep "edge"` |
| Integration | 2/2 contracts pass | `npx vitest run tests/integration/product-api.spec.ts` |
| Build | Must pass | `npm run build` |
| No Regressions | Existing tests pass | `npx playwright test --grep "regression"` (if applicable) |

**Sprint Lock:** All criteria green = LOCKED. Any red = continue execution.

