## Appendix: Test Product Requirements (Sanity Data)

**Required Test Products:**

| Slug | Purpose | Required Fields | Optional Fields |
|------|---------|-----------------|-----------------|
| `sennheiser-hd-800-s` | Golden Path | All fields populated | specifications, overviewFields |
| `test-no-images` | Edge Case | name, price, stock>0, sku | image=null, gallery=[] |
| `test-out-of-stock` | Edge Case | name, price, stock=0, sku | All other fields |
| `test-no-related` | Edge Case | name, price, sku | catalogueLocationKeys=[] |

**Note:** If test products don't exist in Sanity, either:
1. Create them in Sanity Studio (recommended)
2. Mock data in test (acceptable for edge cases)
3. Use existing products with matching characteristics
